{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the warm and bustling world of a seaside Italian bakery in this  online simulation game! Whether you\u2019re a master baker or just starting out, the oven is waiting for you. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a variety of pizzas and breads available for baking in the demo. Make, bake, and sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun alone or with up to four friends. Divide tasks appropriately with your friends. Manage your bakery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet your customers' requests on time. If you keep them waiting too long, they may leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to roll the dough, fire up the ovens, and create the ultimate seaside Italian bakery experience? Gather your friends, start baking, and serve up some delicious chaos!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061480?t=1759373560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4061480?t=1759373560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061480/26a4fbfb2e6f8be634e22e4c52fd3677241903cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759373560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061480/26a4fbfb2e6f8be634e22e4c52fd3677241903cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759373560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Step into the warm and bustling world of a seaside Italian bakery in this  online simulation game! Whether you\u2019re a master baker or just starting out, the oven is waiting for you. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose from a variety of pizzas and breads available for baking in the demo. Make, bake, and sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Have fun alone or with up to four friends. Divide tasks appropriately with your friends. Manage your bakery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet your customers' requests on time. If you keep them waiting too long, they may leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to roll the dough, fire up the ovens, and create the ultimate seaside Italian bakery experience? Gather your friends, start baking, and serve up some delicious chaos!</p>","developers":["Editmode"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4044510","name":"Breezy Bakes Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image